{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:24 2026-06-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:24 2026-06-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:24 2026-06-23 HKT</p><p>今日（23日）早上9時44分，警方接獲中環皇后大道東29號華人行滙豐銀行的職員報案，指懷疑有人出示虛假文書。警員接報到場，在一男一女身上檢獲數份懷疑虛假的銀行文件。經初步調查，姓張（65歲）內地男子與姓孫(50歲)內地女子，涉嫌「行使虛假文書」被捕，現正被扣留調查。案件交由中區警區重案組跟進。</p><img alt=\"警方拘捕一男一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39835d8db057ef7ad8ac8b8688f913f2/2026-06/1_1_28.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方拘捕一男一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d9cbdf5a8fc37dbffbb5293956b6126/2026-06/2_0_29.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"中環華人行滙豐銀行內，有人使用大額偽鈔。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/936682f88cd3d7f11d822b02dbc31170/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-23_at_11_00_55.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查案件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae81ed6a13d8039212bfb5efc9f7d876/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-23_at_11_00_01_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8423921d3fc7d57fd2e0e32b83518e26/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-23_at_11_00_01_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/565820b1bcb71300503354fb8cf3d4d5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-23_at_11_00_01.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T06:19:22.932211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}